# Endy 🔥

**Endy - Bug Bounty Scanner - Made in Termux**

Endy is a lightweight vulnerability scanner for Bug Bounty hunters.
It scans websites for critical vulnerabilities in seconds, directly from your phone!

## Features

- 🔴 $3000 Deserialization Check (Report 3861550)
- 🟠 .env Exposure
- 🟠 .git Config Exposure
- 🟠 SSTI Detection
- 🟠 SQLi Detection
- 🟡 XSS Detection
- 🔓 Port Scan (like Nmap)
- 🕵️ Subdomain Finder
- 🎨 Colored Output
- 📱 Works on Termux (Android)

## Installation in Termux

```bash
pkg update -y
pkg install curl -y
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ysouyah1/Endy/main/endy -O endy
chmod +x endy
./endy
